{"articleNo":"537493","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=537493&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] 「구미시 대학 어울림 페스티벌」 안내","writer":"학생성공과","writeDate":"2025.09.18","hit":"3560","attachments":[{"name":"셔틀버스 운행 시간표.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=537493&attachNo=157622"},{"name":"홍보이미지1.png","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=537493&attachNo=157647"},{"name":"홍보이미지2.png","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=537493&attachNo=157648"},{"name":"홍보이미지3.png","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=537493&attachNo=157649"},{"name":"홍보이미지4.png","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=537493&attachNo=157650"},{"name":"홍보이미지5.png","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=537493&attachNo=157651"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 data-start=\"89\" data-end=\"117\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">「구미시 대학 어울림 페스티벌」</span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">안내&nbsp;</span></b></h3><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n</span><p data-start=\"119\" data-end=\"225\"><br data-start=\"125\" data-end=\"128\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n학생 여러분의 활기찬 대학생활과 지역사회 교류를 위한</span><b><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"> </span><b><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">「구미시 대학 어울림 페스티벌」</span></b></b><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">이 다음과 같이 개최됩니다.</span></p><p data-start=\"119\" data-end=\"225\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">행사 당일&nbsp;</span><strong data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"538\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">참여 학생들의 편의를 위해 금오공대 - 구미대 셔틀버스를 운행</span></b><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">하오니 이용하시기 바랍니다.</span></strong></p><p data-start=\"119\" data-end=\"225\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">셔틀버스 운행 시간표&nbsp;첨부파일&nbsp;참고(</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">셔틀버스 탑승장소: KIT라운지)</span></p><p data-start=\"119\" data-end=\"225\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n학생 여러분의 많은 관심과 참여 바랍니다.</span></p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n</span><h4 data-start=\"232\" data-end=\"245\"><br></h4><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n</span><ul data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"478\">\n<li data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"280\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n</span><p data-start=\"249\" data-end=\"280\"><strong data-start=\"249\" data-end=\"256\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">행사명</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">구미시 대학 어울림 페스티벌</span></p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"281\" data-end=\"381\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n</span><p data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"381\"><strong data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"289\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">일시</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">: 2025년 9월 23일 (화) 17:00 ~ 21:30 (예정 )&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">※ 일정은 상황에 따라 변동될 수 있음</span></p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"402\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n</span><p data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"402\"><strong data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"390\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">장소</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">: 구미대학교 일원</span></p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n</span></li><li data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"402\"><p data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"402\"><strong data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"414\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">주요 내용</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">: 대학 동아리 밴드 및 댄스팀 공연, 초청가수 공연, 홍보부스 운영 등</span></p><p data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"402\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"402\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"402\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmFYHoQTkhPACgJwKoGEDuAbAkgFwEEAtAIQEsApbAV3QGMANZAOgAcA7AcyA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"402\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"402\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"402\"></p></li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
